WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.750
We're so lucky to have dogs.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.458
We really are
so lucky to have dogs.

00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:05.083
You know, it sounds silly,
but they're great teachers.

00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:07.708
They really do show us
the best that we can be.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.083
When they do what they do,
the way we feel in response

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:14.708
is such a great reminder
that that's part of our nature as well.

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:15.917
[dog barks]

00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:17.333
We really serve each other so well.

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:19.208
There's such an eagerness in them too,

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:22.167
to make us happy
and make us whole.

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:25.042
And knowing that's it's without 
an egoic drive,

00:00:25.042 --> 00:00:27.333
that it is kind of an intrinsic part
of their nature,

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:29.708
makes it that much more pure.

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:33.417
Put this relationship anywhere,
anytime, any place,

00:00:33.417 --> 00:00:35.375
it's going to kind of have the same result
and that's special.

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:36.417
[dog barks]

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:37.250
He gets it.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:40.708
[dog barks]
[dog moans]

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:42.500
[laughs]

